MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi, estimating everything on the same grid can be much slower if the individuals are spread out and yet sampled enough to be calculated at a high resolution. What you can do to speed things up is adjust the res or grid options to lower the resolution. I suggest maintaining res>=1.

